<div class="project-container card">
    <div class="project-title">
        <div>
            <a class="project-link" href="/onboarding">
                <h4>Multi-Tenant Institutional AI Onboarding Platform</h4>
            </a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="project-description">
        <p>A live dashboard demo of a multi-tenant compliance onboarding system built for institutional investors.</p>
        <p>
            The production backend runs on .NET 10 and AWS Serverless with a single-table DynamoDB schema, Qdrant vector search,
            and a hybrid RAG pipeline combining BM25 with dense embeddings and parent-child chunking. The agent layer uses the
            Model Context Protocol (MCP) to invoke compliance tools before synthesizing answers, with a Python RAGAS suite
            benchmarking faithfulness on every interaction. The demo UI enforces strict tenant isolation — switching partitions
            resets chat, tool logs, and telemetry to prove zero cross-tenant leakage.
        </p>
    </div>
